<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  Two sets of piece sprites, one per graphics preset (src/Chess/Graphics/CLAUDE.md).
  Beer: the 12 sprites WhiteKing ... BlackPawn are the atlas group "pieces", packed into assets/atlases/pieces.png. Each entry's <atlas><source> is the PNG it came
  from, written by Accept of the Generate panel from artgen/presets/chess_piece.json (assets/artgen/<Name>.png, with its <Name>.artgen.json beside it); the
  background is transparent (alpha 0), so the square under a piece shows through. The sources stay out of the web package.
  The Beer entries are written by the packer, never by hand: Accept of a member in the Generate panel and the Texture editor's Pack repack the group, and so does
  the disabled test ChessPieceAtlasTest.DISABLED_RewriteTheShippedAtlas (config/CLAUDE.md).
  Classic: the 12 sprites ClassicWhiteKing ... ClassicBlackPawn are plain sprites of assets/chess_test.png (700x381, a 6x2 uniform grid: columns King, Queen, Rook,
  Bishop, Knight, Pawn; top row White, bottom row Black; cell about 116.67 x 190.5), written by hand; the packer leaves them as they are.
-->
<root>
